            "content": "October 31, 2024 2.6 $568.70 2.6 39.6\nNovember 30, 2024 0.9 593.39 0.9 38.7\nDecember 31, 2024 5.6 513.93 5.6 33.1\nTotal 9.1 $537.14 9.1",
